[B]Release 1.4.0 (ID 1040070)[/B]

[LIST]
[*][B]FontAwesome Icon Auto-Completion[/B]: Added interactive component [I]XF.cv6IconAutoComplete[/I] (triggered on [I]fa-[/I] + 2 characters) with SVG mask previews inheriting current text color ([I]currentColor[/I]) and smooth [I]XF.Animate[/I] transitions.
[*][B]Icon Helper Service[/B]: Created [I]cv6\Core\Helper\Icon[/I] service for filesystem indexing and registry caching ([I]cv6IconList[/I]).
[*][B]Public & Admin Controllers[/B]: Added auto-complete controllers mapped to route prefix [I]cv6-core[/I].
[*][B]Option Verifiers[/B]: Updated [I]verifyValidIconMandatory[/I] and [I]verifyValidIconOptional[/I] methods in [I]cv6\Core\Option\Check[/I] utilizing native [I]XF\Repository\IconRepository[/I] constants.
[*][B]Options Integration[/B]: Added support for [I]autocomplete=1[/I] in [I]edit_format_params[/I] of ACP options.
[/LIST]
